2, fixing bodyless request receives and improving HTTP/1 request parsing performance (#3063)\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/compare/0.52.1...0.52.2\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/uvicorn/releases/369720964/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/uvicorn/releases/363593351","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/uvicorn/releases/363593351/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Kludex/uvicorn/releases/363593351/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/releases/tag/0.52.1","id":363593351,"author":{"login":"Kludex","id":7353520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNTM1MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7353520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex","html_url":"https://github.com/Kludex","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBYpCG84Vq_6H","tag_name":"0.52.1","target_commitish":"main","name":"Version 0.52.1","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-08-01T18:16:51Z","updated_at":"2026-08-01T18:18:19Z","published_at":"2026-08-01T18:18:19Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/uvicorn/tarball/0.52.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/uvicorn/zipball/0.52.1","body":"### Fixed\r\n\r\n* Complete the closing handshake on server-initiated WebSocket closes in the `websockets-sansio` and `wsproto` implementations, waiting for the client's close reply with a 10 second timeout instead of resetting the connection (#3053)\r\n* Add missing write flow control to the `websockets-sansio` implementation, preventing data truncation on server-initiated closes with large in-flight payloads (#3048)\r\n* Handle connection loss while a WebSocket write is waiting on backpressure (#3050)\r\n* Remove duplicate `Content-Type` and `Content-Length` headers from WebSocket denial responses on the `websockets-sansio` implementation, and deliver non-UTF-8 denial bodies intact (#3041)\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/compare/0.52.0...0.52.1\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/uvicorn/releases/363593351/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/uvicorn/releases/361584449","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/uvicorn/releases/361584449/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Kludex/uvicorn/releases/361584449/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/releases/tag/0.52.0","id":361584449,"author":{"login":"Kludex","id":7353520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNTM1MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7353520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex","html_url":"https://github.com/Kludex","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBYpCG84VjVdB","tag_name":"0.52.0","target_commitish":"main","name":"Version 0.52.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-07-29T07:40:18Z","updated_at":"2026-07-29T07:53:32Z","published_at":"2026-07-29T07:53:32Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/uvicorn/tarball/0.52.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/uvicorn/zipball/0.52.0","body":"This release adds an experimental HTTP/1.1 implementation backed by [zttp](https://zttp.marcelotryle.com/), a sans-IO HTTP parser I've been developing on the side: a core written in Zig, with bindings to Python. It has been running under a fuzzer for some weeks now, and has been through multiple rounds of security auditing.\r\n\r\nIt is still **experimental**, so don't put it in front of production traffic yet. Try it with `--http zttp`, and please send any feedback to the [issue tracker](https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues).\r\n\r\n### Added\r\n\r\n* Add an experimental `zttp` HTTP/1.1 implementation, selectable with `--http zttp` (#2979)\r\n\r\n### Fixed\r\n\r\n* Keep non-ASCII WebSocket request headers intact with websockets 17.0, which encodes them with ISO-8859-1 (#3036)\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/compare/0.51.0...0.52.0","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/uvicorn/releases/361584449/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/uvicorn/releases/350865748","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/uvicorn/releases/350865748/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Kludex/uvicorn/releases/350865748/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/releases/tag/0.51.0","id":350865748,"author":{"login":"Kludex","id":7353520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNTM1MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7353520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex","html_url":"https://github.com/Kludex","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBYpCG84U6clU","tag_name":"0.51.0","target_commitish":"main","name":"Version 0.51.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-07-08T10:50:58Z","updated_at":"2026-07-08T10:58:00Z","published_at":"2026-07-08T10:58:00Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/uvicorn/tarball/0.51.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/uvicorn/zipball/0.51.0","body":"## What's Changed\r\n* Restart workers with overlap on SIGHUP for near-zero-downtime reloads by @Kludex in https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/3025\r\n* Remove colorama from the standard extra by @Kludex in https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/3027\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/compare/0.50.2...0.51.0\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/uvicorn/releases/350865748/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confuse